    <section name="Optimization">
      <chapter_description>
    <p>The Optimization module provides scalar minimization, unconstrained minimization, zero finding, nonlinear equations, nonlinear least squares, nonnegative least squares, quadratic programming, solver options, and a first problem-based modelling layer.</p>
    <p>The implemented algorithms are deterministic dense numerical methods intended for small and medium-size engineering models in Nelson.</p>
